sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018) & Inaba et al. (2019) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling and melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion in galliform plumage stripes — MorphoEval overall 92.2/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py` (overall weighted score: 92.2 / 100, up +44.2 points from 48.0 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script integrates the coupled 2D somitic *Agouti* (*Asip*) prepattern + Connexin40/melanocyte activator-inhibitor reaction-diffusion PDE (achieving anteroposterior orientation index O_AP = 0.981 vs 0.502 in unprepatterned skin beta_A = 0, and bimodal Ashman D = 6.04); reproduces comparative yellow/black stripe widths across all 5 galliform species (quail, pheasant, guineafowl, partridge, turkey) with Pearson r = 0.9956; simulates heterospecific somite-to-dermis chimera grafts (alpha_donor = 0.94) and the 5-regime exogenous *Agouti* protein bead / RNAi sweep; segments N = 4 longitudinal yellow pheomelanin and N = 4 black eumelanin dorsal stripes on a SHA-256-locked *Coturnix japonica* specimen photograph (yellow fraction 0.4420 vs 0.4421 reference, Ashman D = 2.53); and backs its core laws with 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_010_avian_plumage_somite_stripes.lean`. Overall 92.2/100 (faithfulness 91.9, reproducibility 93.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/avian_plumage_somite_stripes_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py at 8871db0, image/png, 864974 B, 2131×1326 px, artifact_sha256 7df61751dd6d40603a24498ac06ade933eeb99553b4fec842048d63ab7c1082b (sha256 7df61751dd6d40603a24498ac06ade933eeb99553b4fec842048d63ab7c1082b), spec_fingerprint 02a8479af5560c95d12d26c94859ee0f020f922c46969b9a4243ec2f1ee4dce8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 02a8479af5560c95d12d26c94859ee0f020f922c46969b9a4243ec2f1ee4dce8; artifact_sha256: 7df61751dd6d40603a24498ac06ade933eeb99553b4fec842048d63ab7c1082b; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/avian_plumage_somite_stripes_reference.json=6029de05099340f7..., datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/galliform_chick_stripes_specimen.jpg=78337aba30f62614..., datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/scout_manifest.json=acb7ac44b807e24b...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D somite-Agouti reaction-diffusion solver to individual 3D cylindrical feather follicle progenitor niches following Lin et al. (2013) to resolve intra-feather barbule chevrons alongside body-wide stripes." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.922"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Slot 010 autonomous loop assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

